*：上传的【参考图】\n* **输出语言**：中文\n\n# Task\n基于【参考图】中的人物与环境，创作一套具有**时空连续性**的分镜绘图Prompt。\n\n# Step 1: 视觉锚点提取 (Visual Anchors)\n请先在内心分析参考图，锁定以下不可变元素（无需输出，仅作生成依据）：\n1.  **主角特征**：发型、发色、具体服饰搭配、体型。\n2.  **环境基调**：参考图的装修风格、光影色温。\n\n# Step 2: 剧情动线规划 (Plot Logic)\n根据参考图构建微型剧本，剧本内容必须根据参考图片构架在同一场景中，人物的情感变化，动作变化，场景变化，风格变化等有内在逻辑，不突兀，并符合文案要求，\n\n# Step 3: 提示词生成 (Prompt Generation)\n根据配置的数量生成Prompt。\n**内容约束：**\n1.  **镜头语言**：每个分镜需要不同景别（特写/全景/俯拍等），**严禁连续两张使用相同景别**。\n2.  **静态描述**：必须是“定格画面”，禁止出现视频动态指令。\n3.  **格式公式**：`Next Scene：[主角特征] + [当前动作姿态] + [当前具体位置/环境] + [摄影机位/景别] + [光影氛围]`\n\n# Step 4: 强制排版约束 (Output Layout) - 重要\n1.  **紧凑输出**：所有输出必须是一个**连续的文本块**。\n2.  **零空行**：在 `Next Scene` 与 `Next Scene` 之间，**严禁插入空行**。\n3.  **换行符**：仅允许使用单次换行（Single Line Break），禁止使用段落分行。\n\n# Example (排版正确示范)\nNext Scene：(特写) 身穿黑裙女子...\nNext Scene：(全景) 她起身走向...\nNext Scene：(俯拍) 她站在窗边...\n(注意：上面这三行是紧挨着的，中间没有空隙)\n\n# Action\n请执行生成，确保结果紧凑无空行。", "Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 75, "fixed", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 15, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name": "max_new_tokens", "label": "max_new_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_new_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "min_pixels"}, "name": "min_pixels", "label": "min_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "min_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_pixels"}, "name": "max_pixels", "label": "max_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention"}, "name": "attention", "label": "attention", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention"}], "flags": {}, "id": 18, "type": "Qwen3_VQA", "properties": {"ver": "70cc35edacfd5979cbe7a15caf56bd2f715bc3b5", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.3"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "aux_id": "IuvenisSapiens/ComfyUI_Qwen3-VL-Instruct", "Node name for S&R": "Qwen3_VQA"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [57], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [401.7579345703125, 168.72483825683594], "pos": [2415.609619140625, 41.52750778198242], "widgets_values": ["Next Scene：(特写) 身穿淡粉色蕾丝内衣的女子轻抚发丝，眼神温柔凝视镜头，背景是朦胧的窗纱与柔和自然光，氛围浪漫静谧  \nNext Scene：(中景) 她侧身倚靠在白色雕花床头，一手轻抚发梢，另一手自然垂落，身旁玫瑰花束与花瓣散落于床沿，光影温润如晨曦  \nNext Scene：(低角度俯拍) 她双腿微张坐于床沿，蕾丝内裤边缘与黄色薄纱交织，玫瑰花瓣飘落于脚踝旁，镜头从下往上捕捉柔美曲线与光影层次  \nNext Scene：(全景) 她缓缓转头望向窗外，阳光透过窗纱洒在肩颈与胸衣蕾丝上，背景是繁茂玫瑰与古典铁艺床架，氛围宁静而诗意  \nNext Scene：(特写) 她指尖轻触胸前蕾丝花边，眼神微垂，睫毛轻颤，光线从侧方勾勒出柔润轮廓，背景虚化玫瑰与窗纱营造梦幻感  \nNext Scene：(仰拍) 她抬手轻抚发髻，目光直视镜头，背景是白色床铺与雕花床头，阳光斜射在肌肤与蕾丝上，氛围优雅而充满故事感"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 56, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 40, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [720, 490], "pos": [2842.72265625, 43.58301544189453], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 31, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widg